{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>咖啡掛耳包/濾掛式咖啡，怎麼沖泡才不令掛耳包滑落？日本咖啡品牌UCC示範給大家看，兼教大家正確沖法，令咖啡掛耳包沖出來的咖啡更好喝。👉follow</p><p>👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p><p>平日沖咖啡掛耳包/濾掛式咖啡時，如果把掛耳包直接掛在杯邊，有可能會掛耳會滑落。UCC分享能將掛耳包固定在原位的簡單方法。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756556136097779712492617.jpeg/Df_icbZ76LUuy_0rLrHeqslulUDFpG858sj10_LI9dM\" alt=\"（圖片截圖︰uccueshimacoffee YouTube）\"><figcaption>（圖片截圖︰uccueshimacoffee YouTube）</figcaption></figure><p>沖咖啡掛耳包正確步驟▼▼</p><p>1.先將咖啡掛耳包向下輕甩2至3下，讓咖啡粉沉底。</p><p>2.撕開咖啡包頂部的虛線。</p><p>3.將咖啡掛耳包兩側的掛耳拉開並掛在杯邊。</p><p>按圖有示範▼▼</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563382718435328412378.jpeg/jAWb1_R4TSC2rdpWITaufHsRVELJEzNVnWi8qJ1ovKg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563385176428544360947.jpeg/iDYRCJ3Mk_cez7k7dxwUKYHY13j7QD9WgegnloHoJ5Y\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563387768639488148906.jpeg/cfpZCXW_ZXNIIjFZFqyE24NK8oPV0JGQp6KpCqeiqQo\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563390230827008685741.jpeg/wuxaEhD884Z4vY1nXR2Arpz25H81R61sqWPrtqlj67Y\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563392894341120532176.jpeg/W1GyTy9hGiS9AIF026Eh-E9l5OkSpPmDMEm31zBJt9c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563395541078016570186.jpeg/X0Xp3z1nNCAqxRuxuHYaUeHwV2EY3V0Qiw03xIsNN8Q\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563398204592128263085.jpeg/C_2e1j-8Rhfh72O4ZCHX_lU-hphVkU1ubd7xNW3e8TU\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756563401321091072781269.jpeg/vrfYv2khNg8vcPMZeVZBkLnp5YSo0MFNyPScw8j0nMM\"><p>4.將掛耳兩側向外折，可將掛耳固定在原位免滑落。</p><p>5.在咖啡掛耳包內倒入剛好浸過咖啡粉的熱水少量。</p><p>6.等20秒左右，分2至3次注入約140ml熱水。先倒9分滿，等水下降到6分滿再倒水。</p><p>7.倒完熱水後等約10秒，移除掛耳包享用咖啡。</p><p>此外，當咖啡掛耳包沖泡過一次後，不建議再沖第二次，因過度萃取會影響咖啡風味，也可能出現更多雜質，故此不適合翻沖。</p><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T02:43:29.708757+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":483,"images":9,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}